/// Same pattern as CloudBreakSpecialPower::friend_newModuleInstance; only
/// the allocation size differs.
///
/// \param thing       The object being built.
/// \param moduleData  The template's shared
///                    GiveOrRestoreUpgradeSpecialPowerModuleData.
/// \return The new module, as a Module pointer.
/// \see GiveOrRestoreUpgradeSpecialPowerModuleData::friend_newModuleData

/// \fn ModuleData *GiveOrRestoreUpgradeSpecialPowerModuleData::friend_newModuleData(INI *ini)
/// \brief Data factory registered for "GiveOrRestoreUpgradeSpecialPower":
