/// \class TaintSpecialPower
/// \ingroup grp_w1020_special_power_module_factories
/// \brief Special power module registered as "TaintSpecialPower": a power
///        applied at a location, configured by an object name, a radius,
///        an FX list and an object creation list.
///
/// A SpecialPowerModule subclass with no per-object state of its own
/// (see the group page). It replaces all three entry points:
/// - TaintSpecialPower::doSpecialPowerAtLocation does nothing when its
///   object is disabled, no location is given or \c TaintObject is empty;
///   otherwise it runs SpecialPowerModule::doSpecialPowerAtLocation, then
///   the class's own work at the location.
/// - The untargeted and object-targeted entry points are the same code as
///   ElvenWoodSpecialPower::doSpecialPower and
///   ElvenWoodSpecialPower::doSpecialPowerAtObject (one copy in the
///   executable, shared with CloudBreakSpecialPower and others). Both do
///   nothing while the object is disabled; otherwise they call this class's
///   location form at the object's own position or at the target's
///   position.
///
/// Open-BFME-1 has a BFME 1 version of the class.
///
/// \par Modding
/// INI fields of TaintSpecialPowerModuleData, after the shared
/// special-power fields: \c TaintObject (an object name, stored as text;
/// the power does nothing while it is empty), \c TaintRadius (real),
/// \c TaintFX (FX list) and \c TaintOCL (object creation list).
/// \see TaintSpecialPower::friend_newModuleInstance,
///      TaintSpecialPowerModuleData::friend_newModuleData

/// \class TaintSpecialPowerModuleData
/// \ingroup grp_w1020_special_power_module_factories
/// \brief Module data for TaintSpecialPower: the shared special-power
///        fields plus object name, radius, FX and object creation list.
///
/// Built by TaintSpecialPowerModuleData::friend_newModuleData; the field
/// list is on TaintSpecialPower.

/// \fn Module *TaintSpecialPower::friend_newModuleInstance(Thing *thing, const ModuleData *moduleData)
/// \brief Instance factory registered for "TaintSpecialPower": creates the
///        module for one object.
