/// \see TaintSpecialPowerModuleData::friend_newModuleData

/// \fn ModuleData *TaintSpecialPowerModuleData::friend_newModuleData(INI *ini)
/// \brief Data factory registered for "TaintSpecialPower": creates the
///        module data and parses the INI block into it.
///
/// Same pattern as CloudBreakSpecialPowerModuleData::friend_newModuleData,
/// with TaintSpecialPowerModuleData::buildFieldParse as the field source.
///
/// \param ini  The reader positioned on the module's block, or null.
/// \return The new module data, as a ModuleData pointer.
/// \see TaintSpecialPower::friend_newModuleInstance
